    "description": {
      "value": "Carved of driftwood stained white with the salt of the sea, a pirate staff has jewels and gold pieces embedded in the wood.\n\nA skull and crossbones sit on top. When used as a weapon, the staff is a staff. While wielding the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Intimidation checks to Coerce.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- - **Cantrip:** gale blast, know direction\n- - **1st:** seashell of stolen sound\n- - **2nd:** obscuring mist, water breathing, water walk\n- - **3rd:** mind of menace, water breathing\n- - **4th:** solid fog, water walk\n- - **5th:** flowing strike, mariner's curse"
